OL,3,AGatwick Airport faced water outage
OL,4,Aafter main burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FGatwick Airport passengers were been
OL,7,Fleft without water after a main burst
OL,8,Fin a nearby field.
OL,10,FSES Water said that it located a burst
OL,11,Fmain in Horley, with parts of the
OL,12,Fairport left without water as a result.
OL,14,FA spokesperson for the airport
OL,15,Fconfirmed that the issue had affected
OL,16,Fwater supply in both terminals and was
OL,17,Funder investigation by SES Water. The
OL,18,Fwater company said it had begun to
OL,19,Frestore supply.
OL,21,FFlights remained unaffected by the
OL,22,Fdisruption, the airport added.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
